msgid "<0>Active transport</0> moves substances against the gradient."
msgstr "<0>Active transport</0> moves substances against the gradient."

msgid "<0>Anthropic</0> reads the material you give Smart add."
msgstr "<0>Anthropic</0> reads the material you give Smart add."

msgid "<0>Apple</0> provides Sign in with Apple."
msgstr "<0>Apple</0> provides Sign in with Apple."

msgid "<0>Apps you connect</0> receive what their permissions allow, and <1>people you share a deck with</1> see what is described under Shared decks."
msgstr "<0>Apps you connect</0> receive what their permissions allow, and <1>people you share a deck with</1> see what is described under Shared decks."

msgid "<0>Choosing a deck (OpenAI)</0>: when you share text to Lymi from another app and its language is unclear, the text, the title of the page it came from and the languages of your decks are sent to pick the deck. When an imported deck’s language is unclear, its name and up to 12 of its terms are sent."
msgstr "<0>Choosing a deck (OpenAI)</0>: when you share text to Lymi from another app and its language is unclear, the text, the title of the page it came from and the languages of your decks are sent to pick the deck. When an imported deck’s language is unclear, its name and up to 12 of its terms are sent."

msgid "<0>Cloudflare</0> hosts the website and apps, the database and file storage, protects the network, routes AI requests, runs Workers AI, converts pictures, keeps operational logs and delivers email when Resend can’t."
msgstr "<0>Cloudflare</0> hosts the website and apps, the database and file storage, protects the network, routes AI requests, runs Workers AI, converts pictures, keeps operational logs and delivers email when Resend can’t."

msgid "<0>Deck style (OpenAI)</0>: after every eight or so new cards or corrections in a deck, up to 60 of its cards and up to 20 of your rewrites of AI text are sent so future meanings match how you write them."
msgstr "<0>Deck style (OpenAI)</0>: after every eight or so new cards or corrections in a deck, up to 60 of its cards and up to 20 of your rewrites of AI text are sent so future meanings match how you write them."

msgid "<0>Diffusion</0>: particles move from high to low concentration."
msgstr "<0>Diffusion</0>: particles move from high to low concentration."

msgid "<0>ElevenLabs</0> provides pronunciation audio for some languages."
msgstr "<0>ElevenLabs</0> provides pronunciation audio for some languages."

msgid "<0>Email and password</0>: we store the address and a hash of the password, never the password itself. A new account is confirmed with a link that lasts 24 hours or, in the iPhone app, a 6-digit code that lasts 15 minutes. A password-reset link lasts one hour."
msgstr "<0>Email and password</0>: we store the address and a hash of the password, never the password itself. A new account is confirmed with a link that lasts 24 hours or, in the iPhone app, a 6-digit code that lasts 15 minutes. A password-reset link lasts one hour."

msgid "<0>Enrichment (OpenAI)</0> fills a new card’s empty fields when you add it in Lymi, and when you ask for it. It receives the card’s term, language, meaning, example and the first 600 characters of its notes, with the deck’s name, description, purpose, your instructions for the deck and up to five recent cards from it. Cards added with an API key or a connected assistant are enriched only when that request asks for it. In each deck you choose which fields AI may fill; the iPhone app’s add screen can turn AI off for a card."
msgstr "<0>Enrichment (OpenAI)</0> fills a new card’s empty fields when you add it in Lymi, and when you ask for it. It receives the card’s term, language, meaning, example and the first 600 characters of its notes, with the deck’s name, description, purpose, your instructions for the deck and up to five recent cards from it. Cards added with an API key or a connected assistant are enriched only when that request asks for it. In each deck you choose which fields AI may fill; the iPhone app’s add screen can turn AI off for a card."

msgid "<0>Expo</0> delivers updates to the iPhone app; each time the app opens it checks for one, which shares the app version and your IP address with Expo."
msgstr "<0>Expo</0> delivers updates to the iPhone app; each time the app opens it checks for one, which shares the app version and your IP address with Expo."

msgid "<0>Google</0> provides Sign in with Google, some pronunciation audio and Japanese lead-in sentences."
msgstr "<0>Google</0> provides Sign in with Google, some pronunciation audio and Japanese lead-in sentences."

msgid "<0>Japanese pronunciation (Cloudflare Workers AI and Google Gemini)</0>: the first time a Japanese card is played, its term, reading and meaning may be sent to write a short lead-in sentence that makes the reading clear."
msgstr "<0>Japanese pronunciation (Cloudflare Workers AI and Google Gemini)</0>: the first time a Japanese card is played, its term, reading and meaning may be sent to write a short lead-in sentence that makes the reading clear."

msgid "<0>marginal cost</0> <1>= cost of 1 more</1>"
msgstr "<0>marginal cost</0> <1>= cost of 1 more</1>"

msgid "<0>Memory hook drafts (OpenAI)</0> run only when you ask for one. They receive the card’s term, meaning and pronunciation and up to eight other meanings from the deck."
msgstr "<0>Memory hook drafts (OpenAI)</0> run only when you ask for one. They receive the card’s term, meaning and pronunciation and up to eight other meanings from the deck."

msgid "<0>OpenAI</0> provides enrichment, deck style, memory hook drafts, deck choice and some pronunciation audio."
msgstr "<0>OpenAI</0> provides enrichment, deck style, memory hook drafts, deck choice and some pronunciation audio."

msgid "<0>opportunity cost</0> <1>= what you give up</1>"
msgstr "<0>opportunity cost</0> <1>= what you give up</1>"

msgid "<0>Osmosis</0>: water crosses a membrane toward more dissolved substance."
msgstr "<0>Osmosis</0>: water crosses a membrane toward more dissolved substance."

msgid "<0>PostHog</0> provides product analytics and error reports in its EU cloud."
msgstr "<0>PostHog</0> provides product analytics and error reports in its EU cloud."

