msgid "We delete your profile and photo, sign-in records and sessions, decks and cards that only you use, pictures and audio, reviews and schedule, settings, reminders, connected apps and your Activity. Your API keys stop working at once. We ask PostHog to delete your analytics profile and its events. If you confirm with Sign in with Apple, we also revoke Lymi’s access to your Apple account; otherwise you can remove Lymi from your Apple or Google account settings. We send one last email to confirm the deletion."
msgstr "We delete your profile and photo, sign-in records and sessions, decks and cards that only you use, pictures and audio, reviews and schedule, settings, reminders, connected apps and your Activity. Your API keys stop working at once. We ask PostHog to delete your analytics profile and its events. If you confirm with Sign in with Apple, we also revoke Lymi’s access to your Apple account; otherwise you can remove Lymi from your Apple or Google account settings. We send one last email to confirm the deletion."

msgid "We do this on the basis of our legitimate interest in understanding and improving Lymi. To object, email <0>hello@lymi.app</0> and we will stop product analytics for your account, including from connected apps and background work."
msgstr "We do this on the basis of our legitimate interest in understanding and improving Lymi. To object, email <0>hello@lymi.app</0> and we will stop product analytics for your account, including from connected apps and background work."

msgid "We don’t sell your data, show ads, or track you across other companies’ apps and websites. We send data to the providers below only to run the feature you are using."
msgstr "We don’t sell your data, show ads, or track you across other companies’ apps and websites. We send data to the providers below only to run the feature you are using."

msgid "We send email only about your account: confirming an address, resetting a password, telling you an address already has an account, deck invitations, the code that confirms deleting your account, and the confirmation that it was deleted. There is no newsletter. <0>Resend</0> delivers our email and receives the recipient, subject and message; <1>Cloudflare Email Service</1> delivers it when Resend isn’t available. Resend tells us when an email bounces or is marked as spam."
msgstr "We send email only about your account: confirming an address, resetting a password, telling you an address already has an account, deck invitations, the code that confirms deleting your account, and the confirmation that it was deleted. There is no newsletter. <0>Resend</0> delivers our email and receives the recipient, subject and message; <1>Cloudflare Email Service</1> delivers it when Resend isn’t available. Resend tells us when an email bounces or is marked as spam."

msgid "We store the decks, series and sections you create or join, and every card in them: term, meaning, pronunciation, example, notes, memory hook, tags, source, language, picture and audio. We also store each review and grade, the schedule, your daily goal, streak and rest days, your time zone, settings, what you told us you are learning when you started, and an Activity record of changes."
msgstr "We store the decks, series and sections you create or join, and every card in them: term, meaning, pronunciation, example, notes, memory hook, tags, source, language, picture and audio. We also store each review and grade, the schedule, your daily goal, streak and rest days, your time zone, settings, what you told us you are learning when you started, and an Activity record of changes."

msgid "We update this policy when Lymi or the law changes, and change the date above. When a change materially affects your rights, we will tell you in Lymi or by email. Questions and privacy requests go to <0>hello@lymi.app</0>."
msgstr "We update this policy when Lymi or the law changes, and change the date above. When a change materially affects your rights, we will tell you in Lymi or by email. Questions and privacy requests go to <0>hello@lymi.app</0>."

msgid "We use <0>PostHog</0>’s EU service to understand how Lymi is used. Events pass through our own servers first, which remove anything not on a fixed list and add the country the request came from, as Cloudflare works it out from your IP address. That country is the only location we record. PostHog does not look up your location, record sessions or capture clicks automatically."
msgstr "We use <0>PostHog</0>’s EU service to understand how Lymi is used. Events pass through our own servers first, which remove anything not on a fixed list and add the country the request came from, as Cloudflare works it out from your IP address. That country is the only location we record. PostHog does not look up your location, record sessions or capture clicks automatically."

msgid "We use access controls, encrypted connections and our providers’ security controls to protect data, but no online service can guarantee absolute security. Keep API keys and connection tokens to yourself. Lymi is not directed to children who cannot lawfully consent to this processing."
msgstr "We use access controls, encrypted connections and our providers’ security controls to protect data, but no online service can guarantee absolute security. Keep API keys and connection tokens to yourself. Lymi is not directed to children who cannot lawfully consent to this processing."

